flowchart TB
  Catalog[Live enabled model catalogue] --> Picker[Model picker]
  Preference[Durable preferred model] --> Picker
  Picker --> Probe[Local capability probe]
  Probe --> Recommend[Allowlisted fit recommendation]
  Recommend --> Manual{User choice preserved?}
  Manual --> Selected[Selected model ID]
  Selected --> Registry[Server-owned artifact registry]
  Registry --> Known{Verified mapping exists?}
  Known -->|No| Unavailable[Blocked with stable reason]
  Known -->|Yes| Admission[Resource and user admission]
  Admission --> Prepare[Prepare or join operation]
  Prepare --> Ready{Loaded and floors satisfied?}
  Ready -->|Yes| Session[AI-ready session lease]
  Ready -->|No| Retry[Queued, retryable or blocked]
  Session --> Features[AI feature gate opens]
  Unavailable --> NonAI[Continue without AI]
  Retry --> NonAI
